[82.700309, "o", "11:from dataclasses import dataclass\r\n57:class Source(ABC, Generic[X]):  # noqa: B024\r\n60:    Base class for all input sources. Do not subclass this.\r\n62:    If you want to implement a custom connector, instead subclass one\r\n70:class StatefulSourcePartition(ABC, Generic[X, S]):\r\n143:class FixedPartitionedSource(Source[X], Generic[X, S]):\r\n199:class StatelessSourcePartition(ABC, Generic[X]):\r\n253:class DynamicSource(Source[X]):\r\n285:class _SimplePollingPartition(StatefulSourcePartition[X, S]):\r\n333:class SimplePollingSource(FixedPartitionedSource[X, Sn]):\r\n339:    class URLSource(SimplePollingSource):\r\n361:    {py:obj}`Source` subclasses where you can have increased\r\n366:    @dataclass\r\n367:    class Retry(Exception):\r\n455:def batch(ib: Iterable[X], batch_size: int) -> Iterator[List[X]]:\r\n"]
